> discontinuities roundeven(x) in 0..3
discontinuities of roundeven(x):
  x = 0.5 (~1/2): jump from 0 to 1 (size 1) (f = 0 there)
  x = 1.5 (~3/2): jump from 1 to 2 (size 1) (f = 2 there)
  x = 2.5 (~5/2): jump from 2 to 3 (size 1) (f = 2 there)
  checked numerically: a grid of 20001 points, jumps located by bisection, limits from both sides
